#X text 355 145 <--- DAW detection: if [playhead ] BPM outlet emits a non-zero value \, we are inside a DAW, f 27;
#X text 239 334 <--- the first time a non-0 BPM value is received: \; 1 set the clock to DAW mode \; 2 send the BPM value to the clock \; 3 re-sync the clock, f 32;
#X text 109 84 [playhead ] is always streaming regardless of playback state \, even if we are not inside a DAW (!). so we only care about value changes, f 24;
#X text 571 602 only set the clock to DAW mode on the first time we receive a non-0 BPM value. this makes it possible to switch to internal mode if we please \, even when inside a DAW., f 34;
#X text 694 166 <--- truncate PPQ position to get the integer part, f 22;
#X text 717 234 when playback/recording starts \, we use the PPQ position to sync our clock to the grid, f 24;
#X text 427 416 we only need the first 2 quarter notes to sync to the grid. --->, f 19;
#X obj 43 765 outlet;
#X msg 180 684 sync;
#X msg 280 684 ext;
#X obj 474 765 outlet;
#X text 427 791 float: clock rate (BPM);
#X text 43 791 this outlet is made to interact with euclid1913's master clock: \; \; float: 1 to start \, 0 to stop \; sync: resync the clock \; ext: set the clock to external mode;
